---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="没有找到"><section class="not-found container"><p class="eyebrow">404 · LOST IN THE WIND</p><h1>这条路，<br />暂时没有通向任何地方。</h1><p>也许页面搬家了，或者它还没有被写出来。</p><div><a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页</a><a class="button" href="/search/">搜索本站</a></div></section></Layout>
<style>.not-found{min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;padding-block:80px}.not-found h1{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1}.not-found>p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:19px}.not-found>div{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}</style>
